# Stitch collaboration

When the user asks to design, generate, sync, or implement UI with Stitch:

1. Prefer Stitch MCP tools (`list_projects`, `generate_screen_from_text`, `get_screen`, download HTML/image, etc.).
2. Load the matching skill under `.agents/skills/` (e.g. `generate-design`, `react-components`, `enhance-prompt`).
3. Keep cinematic marketing code in `gvg-os/apps/website`; feature UI in `gvg-os/apps/portal`.
4. Store durable design artifacts under `.stitch/` (`DESIGN.md`, `screens/`, `exports/`).
5. Never commit real `STITCH_API_KEY` values — use `.env` / Cursor secrets only.
